  "summary": "International political declaration launched on 21 September 2026 on the sidelines of the UN General Assembly by Finnish President Alexander Stubb and Norwegian Prime Minister Jonas Gahr Støre. Endorsed by 30 officials: leaders or senior officials representing 28 countries, plus the President of the European Commission. Urges mandatory pre-deployment safety testing, independent third-party evaluations, incident reporting, and exploring an international institution capable of standard-setting and verification for frontier AI models.",
